### They celebrate a small everyday skill that makes care easier.

4 of 127 posts.

They celebrate getting out of bottles, accepting solids, eating broccoli through pretend vehicles, or calming during dressing with a familiar song. Named ages are 12.5, 13 and 14 months; the solids account leaves age unknown. Several describe an attempt that worked after another approach did not.

